  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1610.01 Issuance of Certificates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1610.01 Issuance of Certificates. The department shall issue:\n\n(a) An assistant operator certificate to each individual who takes basic training but does not take or does not pass the examination;\n\n(b) A principal operator certificate to each individual who takes basic training and passes the examination; and\n\n(c) A renewal certificate to each operator who renews their certification in accordance with Env-Sw 1611.\n\nSource. #10600, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13623, eff 5-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1600.html"
